 "uncertain_notes": [
  "Captain's Guide: game_terms_v271 gives 大航海 = 'Grand Voyage', but the earlier batches and the item 大航海挂机次数券 use 'Great Voyage'; 'Great Voyage' was kept (e.g. 大航海商店 = 'Great Voyage Shop').",
  "Captain's Guide: 天梯商店 = 'Arena Shop' (game term), so 天梯币 was rendered 'Arena Coins' to match the shop; 天梯赛 = 'Ladder' (game term).",
  "Captain's Guide: 角色突破 kept as the in-game 'Hero Break' and 角色升级 as the in-game 'Character Level Up', even though the two use different nouns.",
  "Captain's Guide: 装备精粹 / 精粹石 has no in-game English yet; rendered 'Quintessence' / 'Quintessence Stones' (distinct from 精炼 = Refine and 精淬石 = Purification Stone).",
  "Captain's Guide: 海域争霸 (a sea-war mode whose shop sells warships and refinement items) has no in-game English; rendered 'Sea Conquest' by analogy with 海岛争霸 = Island Conquest.",
  "TableNewStrongGuideTarget row 18 (primary bundle): label 晶魂商城 (Crystal Soul Shop) but the text says 'from the Arena Shop' (天梯商店); translated as written. Row 15: label 讨伐任务 (Bounty Quest) but text mentions Blood Battle; translated as written. Row 37 (other bundle): label 黄金试炼 (Golden Trial) but text mentions Hero Trial; translated as written.",
  "Character names in guide labels follow game_terms_v271 exactly (大熊 = 'Bartholomew Kuma', 艾斯 = 'Portgas D. Ace', 莫利亚 = 'Gecko Moria', 汉库珂 = 'Boa Hancock', 杰克斯 = 'Shanks')."
 ]
